                                    p.fs-14.fw-350.reason Your leave request from Sep 20–23 was <span class="fw-900 text-black-light">rejected </span> by <span class="fw-900 text-black-light">Manager Ali.</span> Reason: “Team workload high.”
                                    p.fs-14.fw-350.time  1 hours ago
